  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening jurisdictional &amp; communicational capacities of the IACtHR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this project is to contribute to the protection and guarantee of human rights in the Americas. Through this project, the IACtHR aims to: (a) strengthen compliance with the measures of reparation and provisional measures ordered by the Court; (b) disseminate its work and case law among the States Parties to the American Convention on Human Rights and their populations; (c) ensure the support of the Victims&#x2019; Legal Assistance Fund for those who require it, and d) facilitate litigation before the IACtHR by optimizing its internal procedures.</narrative>
  </description>
